    "description": "Your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a> gain an additional <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>, which they must meet the prerequisites for, and another <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> every 3rd level (as per a normal character). Additionally, your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Followers\" title=\"Followers\">Followers</a> now benefit from changes to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ability_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Scores\">Ability Scores</a> and bonus <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a> from their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a>; if your Follower's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species\" title=\"Species\">Species</a> does not change their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ability_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Scores\">Ability Scores</a>, you can raise a single one of their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Abilities\" title=\"Abilities\">Abilities</a> from a 10 to a 12.",
